# SlicerDDSurfer extension description for Slicer ExtensionsIndex submission.
# Keep `depends` synchronized with top-level CMakeLists.txt EXTENSION_DEPENDS.
scm git
scmurl https://github.com/ChengjinLii/SlicerDDSurfer.git
scmrevision main
depends SlicerDMRI PyTorch
build_subdirectory .
homepage https://github.com/ChengjinLii/SlicerDDSurfer
category Diffusion
contributors SlicerDDSurfer Team
description Multi-workflow diffusion MRI extension for surface reconstruction, parcellation, segmentation, microstructure, tractography, bundles, and connectome analysis.
enabled 1
